// LOS ORIGINATION LAYER (append). Do not delete URLA borrower models above.
// Software is LOS-shaped regardless of licensing. nmlsId stays EMPTY by default.
// Do NOT invent an NMLS number. Going live as an originator = Charles/counsel gate.
